           body: |
             Local build (LauShyO/nomacs) from upstream master b67b4d7 + local patches:
 
             - Frameless mode (F10, non-fullscreen): the area outside the image is now truly transparent. The viewport no longer paints the opaque theme background over the translucent frameless window, and the main window no longer fills the strips around the central widget. Full screen and normal mode are unchanged. Patch file: .local/frameless-transparency.patch
